,[1464,"^4",["^ ","^1<","4.28","^1=","1","^1>","2.6","^1?","2024-07-26T12:54:35.521Z","^1@","2024-07-22T06:54:35.522Z","^1A","5"],536894074]],["^15",[1464,"^H",2,536894074]],["^15",[1464,"^;","~u66a56a82-4869-47c5-b0f1-814b5be4c9a3",536880097]],["^15",[1465,"^Q","Я ид**у** дом**о**й (I go home)",536880097]],["^15",[1465,"^O","^16",536880097]],["^15",[1465,"^F",1459,536880097]],["^15",[1465,"^X",885,536880097]],["^15",[1465,"^V",1437,536880097]],["^15",[1465,"^U",2,536895123]],["^15",[1465,"^U",885,536895123]],["^15",[1465,"^;","~u66a56a82-ad52-4f5f-ad7c-bed1f7e5e9c1",536880097]],["^15",[1467,"^Q","я хож**у** на раб**о**ту из д**о**ма (I go to work from home)",536880097]],["^15",[1467,"^O","^16",536880097]],["^15",[1467,"^F",1434,536880097]],["^15",[1467,"^X",885,536880097]],["^15",[1467,"^V",1435,536880097]],["^15",[1467,"^U",2,536895123]],["^15",[1467,"^U",885,536895123]],["^15",[1467,"^;","~u66a56a82-70b8-4b40-bef6-b4efb2ecbae5",536880097]],["^15",[1469,"^K",1722116738559,536880100]],["^15",[1469,"^N",20240719,536880100]],["^15",[1469,"^@",true,536880100]],["^15",[1469,"^Y","2024-07-19",536880100]],["^15",[1469,"^11","2024-07-19",536880100]],["^15",[1469,"^B",1722116738559,536880100]],["^15",[1469,"^;","~u66fc6de6-12b4-4077-a7b9-142251b4024e",536896353]],["^15",[1470,"^Q","Summary: 17 items, 17 review counts [[2024-07-19]]",536880100]],["^15",[1470,"^O","^16",536880100]],["^15",[1470,"^F",2100,536894077]],["^15",[1470,"^X",124,536880100]],["^15",[1470,"^V",1238,536880100]],["^15",[1470,"^U",124,536892706]],["^15",[1470,"^U",889,536892706]],["^15",[1470,"^U",1469,536892706]],["^15",[1470,"^H",1469,536896353]],["^15",[1470,"^;","~u66a56a82-8437-4624-b07b-641da93f21e6",536880100]],["^15",[1471,"^Q","Remembered:   5 (29%)",536880100]],["^15",[1471,"^O","^16",536880100]],["^15",[1471,"^F",1470,536880100]],["^15",[1471,"^X",124,536880100]],["^15",[1471,"^V",1470,536880100]],["^15",[1471,"^U",124,536892706]],["^15",[1471,"^U",889,536892706]],["^15",[1471,"^U",1469,536892706]],["^15",[1471,"^;","~u66a56a82-2e1d-47f0-9d4e-3a9c151492ec",536880100]],["^15",[1472,"^Q","Forgotten :   12 (70%)",536880100]],["^15",[1472,"^O","^16",536880100]],["^15",[1472,"^F",1471,536880100]],["^15",[1472,"^X",124,536880100]],["^15",[1472,"^V",1470,536880100]],["^15",[1472,"^U",124,536892706]],["^15",[1472,"^U",889,536892706]],["^15",[1472,"^U",1469,536892706]],["^15",[1472,"^;","~u66a56a82-6d0d-436e-8369-d948d37b3eaf",536880100]],["^15",[1473,"^Q","https://adamtheautomator.com/docker-compose-tutorial/",536880114]],["^15",[1473,"^O","^16",536880107]],["^15",[1473,"^@",false,536880107]],["^15",[1473,"^F",549,536880107]],["^15",[1473,"^X",543,536880107]],["^15",[1473,"^V",549,536880111]],["^15",[1473,"^U",543,536880108]],["^15",[1473,"^?",["^ "],536880114]],["^15",[1473,"^;","~u66a56a97-a23c-4322-be54-a2744586c512",536880107]],["^15",[1474,"^12",2,536880118]],["^15",[1475,"^K",1722158236530,536880121]],["^15",[1475,"^[",1476,536880122]],["^15",[1475,"^@",false,536880121]],["^15",[1475,"^Y","maths",536880121]],["^15",[1475,"^11","maths",536880121]],["^15",[1475,"^B",1722158236530,536880121]],["^15",[1475,"^;","~u67b71e8a-0bbb-418c-9374-82224ead4b75",536906344]],["^15",[1476,"^3","- https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC4111019/\n- machine learning\n\t- resources\n\t\t- [explained AI](https://explained.ai/)\n\t\t\t- [matrix calculus](https://explained.ai/matrix-calculus/index.html)\n\t\t- [Fast AI: practical deep learning](https://course.fast.ai/)\n- Multivariate linear regression\n\t- To calculate the derivative of \\( f(b) = b^T X^T X b \\), we can use properties of quadratic forms and matrix calculus.\n\t  \n\t  **Step-by-Step Explanation:**\n\t  \n\t  1. **Understand the Function:**\n\t\t- The function \\( f(b) \\) is a quadratic form in terms of vector \\( b \\).\n\t\t- It represents the squared norm of the linear transformation \\( Xb \\), i.e., \\( \\|Xb\\|^2 \\).\n\t\t  \n\t\t  2. **Express Using Norms:**\n\t\t- Recognize that \\( f(b) = (Xb)^T (Xb) = \\|Xb\\|^2 \\).\n\t\t  \n\t\t  3. **Apply Chain Rule:**\n\t\t- Let’s denote \\( y = Xb \\), then \\( f(b) = y^T y \\).\n\t\t- The derivative of \\( y^T y \\) with respect to \\( y \\) is \\( 2y \\).\n\t\t- Using the chain rule, \\( \\frac{df}{db} = \\frac{df}{dy} \\cdot \\frac{dy}{db} \\).\n\t\t  \n\t\t  4. **Differentiate:**\n\t\t- \\( \\frac{df}{dy} = 2y^T \\) (row vector).\n\t\t- \\( \\frac{dy}{db} = X \\).\n\t\t- Multiplying these, \\( \\frac{df}{db} = 2y^T X = 2(Xb)^T X \\).\n\t\t  \n\t\t  5. **Transpose for Gradient:**\n\t\t- Since gradients are column vectors, take the transpose:\n\t\t  \\[ \\nabla_b f(b) = 2 X^T X b \\]\n\t\t  \n\t\t  **Final Answer:**\n\t\t  \n\t\t  The derivative of \\( b^T X^T X b \\) with respect to \\( b \\) is:\n\t\t  \n\t\t  \\[\n\t\t  \\boxed{2 X^\\top X b}\n\t\t  \\]",536906344]],["^15",[1476,"^19",1722158237140,536880122]],["^15",[1476,"^1:","~m1740006031717",536906345]],["^15",[1476,"^Z","pages/maths.md",536880122]],["^15",[1476,"^1;",55,536904132]],["^15",[1477,"^Q","https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC4111019/",536880122]],["^15",[1477,"^O","^16",536880122]],["^15",[1477,"^F",1475,536880122]],["^15",[1477,"^X",1475,536880122]],["^15",[1477,"^V",1475,536880122]],["^15",[1477,"^U",1475,536880122]],["^15",[1477,"^;","~u66a60c9d-0dc8-4399-a1c7-22c697451df0",536880122]],["^15",[1479,"^K",1722158237412,536880130]],["^15",[1479,"^N",20240721,536880130]],["^15",[1479,"^@",true,536880130]],["^15",[1479,"^Y","2024-07-21",536880130]],["^15",[1479,"^11","2024-07-21",536880130]],["^15",[1479,"^B",1722158237412,536880130]],["^15",[1479,"^;","~u66e6325f-c293-4208-b99a-83a2c30a7b2a",536890879]],["^15",[1483,"^Q","present",536880133]],["^15",[1483,"^O","^16",536880133]],["^15",[1483,"^F",993,536880133]],["^15",[1483,"^X",919,536880133]],["^15",[1483,"^V",993,536880133]],["^15",[1483,"^U",2,536880133]],["^15",[1483,"^U",919,536880133]],["^15",[1483,"^;","~u66a60c9d-f1fb-4ceb-9c31-9f5d170e7f81",536880133]],["^15",[1484,"^Q","prese